{"strongs": "H4832", "word": "מַרְפֵּא", "translit": "mar.pe", "root": "רפא", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "healing, cure, health", "definition": "מַרְפֵּא , מַרְפֵּה noun masculine Eccl 10:4 healing, cure, health (usually figurative); — absolute מַרְפֵּא Jer 14:19 +, מַרְפֵּה Jer 8:15 construct מַרְפֵּא Prov 15:4 — 1. healing, cure , of national woes, Jer 8:15 ; Jer 14:19 b (|| שָׁלוֺם ), Jer 36:6 (+ אֲרֻכָה ); especially ׳ אֵין לָנוּ מ Jer 14:19 a there is no cure for us , ׳ עַד לְאֵין מ 2Chr 36:16 . 2. figurative of person, health, profit , Prov 4:22 (|| חַיִּים ), Prov 12:18 ; Prov 13:17 ; Prov 16:24 with spiritual implication Mal 3:20 ׳ אֵין מ Prov 6:15 = Prov 29:1 ׳ לֵב מ Prov 14:30 a mind of health (healthy, composed, mind), compare ׳ מ alone = composure Eccl 10:4 לְשׁוֺן ׳ מ Eccl 15:4 healing of the tongue , = a soothing tongue (Toy). 3. literally, of disease , ׳ לְאֵין מ 2Chr 21:18 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8052')\">BDB8052</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4832')\">H4832</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8051')\">BDB8051</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8053')\">BDB8053</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַרְפֵּא</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מַרְפֵּה</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Eccl 10:4\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(21,10,4)\">Eccl 10:4</ref></sup> <highlightword>healing, cure, health</highlightword> (usually figurative); — absolute <bdbheb>מַרְפֵּא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 14:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,19)\">Jer 14:19</ref> +, <bdbheb>מַרְפֵּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 8:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,15)\">Jer 8:15</ref> construct <bdbheb>מַרְפֵּא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 15:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,4)\">Prov 15:4</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>healing, cure</highlight>, of national woes, <ref ref=\"Jer 8:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,15)\">Jer 8:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 14:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,19)\">Jer 14:19</ref>b (|| <bdbheb>שָׁלוֺם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Jer 36:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,6)\">Jer 36:6</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֲרֻכָה</bdbheb>); especially <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֵין לָנוּ מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 14:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,19)\">Jer 14:19</ref>a <highlight>there is no cure for us</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַד לְאֵין מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,16)\">2Chr 36:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> figurative of person, <highlight>health, profit</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Prov 4:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,4,22)\">Prov 4:22</ref> (|| <bdbheb>חַיִּים</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Prov 12:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,18)\">Prov 12:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 13:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,17)\">Prov 13:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 16:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,24)\">Prov 16:24</ref> with spiritual implication <ref ref=\"Mal 3:20\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,20)\">Mal 3:20</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֵין מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,15)\">Prov 6:15</ref> = <ref ref=\"Prov 29:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,29,1)\">Prov 29:1</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bd